  "description": "The Nuroad Exc's brand new alumium frame is built for comfort, confidence-inspiring handling and all-round versatility. With frame clearance for tyres up to 40mm as well as mudguards, you've a wide choice of tyres to add both grip and comfort to your riding. Carbon fork blades help take the sting out of rough road surfaces too, reducing the tiring effect of riding long distances on unmade roads. Geometry based arund our Attain bikes is designed to be stable, comfortable for long days in the saddle and sizing based on our Cross Race series means you'll be confident on even rough and slippery surfaces. Internal cable routing keeps gear shifts clean and accurate in muddy or gritty conditions, and the replaceable derailleur hanger is easily replaceable in the event of accidental damage. Ride further, ride more adventurously. The Nuroad Exc will take you there.",
